msgstr ""
"Optional. This is the amount as stated, not an expense: it will land in the "
"P&L only after sorting out."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:301
msgid ""
"Одной строкой: от кого бумага и за что. Поможет бухгалтеру найти поставщика."
msgstr ""
"In one line: who the paper is from and what for. It will help the accountant "
"find the supplier."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:315
msgid ""
"С какой точки бумага. Не куда ляжет расход — это решает бухгалтер при "
"разборе."
msgstr ""
"Which unit the paper is from. Not where the expense will land — the "
"accountant decides that when sorting it out."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:344
msgid "Вас ещё не завели ни к одному партнёру, поэтому бумаг у вас нет."
msgstr "You have not been added to any partner yet, so you have no papers."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:381
#, python-format
