msgstr "%(kind)s from unit %(unit)s"

#: src/web/papers_views.py:458
msgid ""
"Бумага принята и ждёт разбора бухгалтером. В P&L её ещё нет: сумма появится "
"там, когда бухгалтер назначит статью и период."
msgstr ""
"The paper has been received and is waiting for the accountant to sort it "
"out. It is not in the P&L yet: the amount will appear there once the "
"accountant assigns the item and the period."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:464
#, python-format
msgid "Бумага разобрана: строка учтена в периоде %(month)s."
msgstr ""
"The paper has been sorted out: the row has been recorded in period %(month)s."

#: src/web/papers_views.py:469
#, python-format
msgid ""
