msgstr "← Back to invoices"

#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/inbox.html:26
msgid "Строки без статьи. Деньги уже в P&L, но не там, где их будут искать."
msgstr ""
"Rows with no item. The money is already in the P&L, but not where people "
"will look for it."

#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/inbox.html:27
#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/inbox.html:78
#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/invoices.html:26
#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/papers.html:15
#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/papers.html:18
