msgstr "The inbox is empty."

#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/inbox.html:75
msgid "У всех строк есть статья: разбирать нечего."
msgstr "Every row has an item: there is nothing to sort out."

#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/inbox.html:80
#: src/web/templates/web/suppliers/papers.html:28
#, python-format
